<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;PATTERNED SHIELDING STRUCTURE AND INTEGRATED INDUCTOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Patterned Shielding Structure and Integrated Inductor is a design concept combining electromagnetic shielding and inductance in a single component, aimed at reducing the size and complexity of electronic devices."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;US PATENT 11387315&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"US patent 11387315 is a legal filing for the Patterned Shielding Structure and Integrated Inductor, highlighting its significance in the field of electronics."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CAPTAIN RACHEL JENKINS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Captain Rachel Jenkins is a military leader overseeing operations in a ravaged city, dealing with the aftermath of a bombardment and investigating a salvaged device."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LIEUTENANT MICHAEL PATEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lieutenant Michael Patel is a trusted engineer assisting Captain Jenkins, providing technical analysis of the salvaged device."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RAVAGED CITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ravaged City is a once-thriving metropolis now in ruins, serving as the setting for the military operation and the discovery of the device."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RESEARCH FACILITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Research Facility is a site targeted during the bombardment, containing the salvaged device and possibly other technologies."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENEMY'S ADVANCED ARTILLERY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Enemy's Advanced Artillery represents the threat against which the technology could be a game-changer, hinting at a larger conflict."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BOMBARDMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bombardment is the act of targeting the city and the research facility, causing widespread destruction and prompting the military operation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The event involves the act of bombardment itself, which is the primary focus of the mysteries and intentions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TECHNICIANS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Technicians are part of the team working to analyze the recovered data from the research facility."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DATA ANALYSIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Data Analysis is the process of examining the salvaged data to understand the technology and its potential applications."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOFT BLUE LIGHT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Soft Blue Light is a phenomenon observed emanating from the device, suggesting it has some form of active functionality."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MANGLED DEVICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mangled Device is the salvaged component with an intricate pattern of shielding and a coiled inductor, discovered at the research facility."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ELECTROMAGNETIC PULSES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Electromagnetic Pulses are the type of energy the device is designed to absorb and redirect."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENERGY FLOW STABILIZATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Energy Flow Stabilization is the function of the integrated inductor in the device, helping to stabilize the energy flow."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ADVANCED TECHNOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Advanced Technology refers to the cutting-edge nature of the device and its potential to revolutionize electronic devices."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CLUE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Clue is the salvaged device and the soft blue light it emits, suggesting it holds important information about the enemy's intentions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRUTH ABOUT THE ENEMY'S INTENTIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The event involves uncovering the real intentions behind the bombardment, which is the core mystery the person aims to solve."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MYSTERIES OF THE BOMBARDMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The event involves the unexplained aspects of the bombardment that need to be solved or understood."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENEMY'S INTENTIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The event involves uncovering the true motives or plans of the enemy responsible for the bombardment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRUTH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The event involves discovering the real facts or reality behind the bombardment and the enemy's actions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENEMY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The organization or group responsible for the bombardment, whose intentions need to be uncovered."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0071</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;PATTERNED SHIELDING STRUCTURE AND INTEGRATED INDUCTOR&quot;" target="&quot;US PATENT 11387315&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Patterned Shielding Structure and Integrated Inductor is legally protected by US patent 11387315, highlighting its importance in the field of electronics."</data>
      <data key="d5">"legal protection, significance"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0071</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CAPTAIN RACHEL JENKINS&quot;" target="&quot;LIEUTENANT MICHAEL PATEL&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Lieutenant Michael Patel assists Captain Rachel Jenkins in analyzing the salvaged device, indicating a collaborative effort in the investigation."</data>
      <data key="d5">"collaboration, technical analysis"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0071</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CAPTAIN RACHEL JENKINS&quot;" target="&quot;RAVAGED CITY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Captain Rachel Jenkins operates in the ravaged city, dealing with the aftermath of a bombardment and investigating the device."</data>
      <data key="d5">"military leadership, investigation"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0071</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;LIEUTENANT MICHAEL PATEL&quot;" target="&quot;RESEARCH FACILITY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Lieutenant Michael Patel and Captain Rachel Jenkins discover a salvaged device from the research facility, suggesting a link to the facility's development."</data>
      <data key="d5">"discovery, technical analysis"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0071</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RESEARCH FACILITY&quot;" target="&quot;ENEMY'S ADVANCED ARTILLERY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The research facility, containing the salvaged device, was a high-priority target for the enemy's bombardment, indicating the strategic importance of the technology."</data>
      <data key="d5">"strategic importance, high-priority target"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0071</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BOMBARDMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ENEMY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The bombardment is an action carried out by the enemy, whose intentions need to be understood."</data>
      <data key="d5">"action, intentions"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0071</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MYSTERIES OF THE BOMBARDMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ENEMY'S INTENTIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The mysteries of the bombardment involve understanding the enemy's intentions."</data>
      <data key="d5">"understanding, uncovering"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0071</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MYSTERIES OF THE BOMBARDMENT&quot;" target="&quot;TRUTH&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The mysteries of the bombardment involve discovering the truth about the enemy's intentions."</data>
      <data key="d5">"discovery, truth"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0071</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ENEMY'S INTENTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;TRUTH&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Discovering the truth involves uncovering the enemy's intentions."</data>
      <data key="d5">"truth, intentions"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0071</data>
    </edge>
  </graph>
</graphml>
